{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026nCP9aFqWPp1793544504.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一連四天的美酒佳餚巡禮，最後一天在中環海濱舉行，有參展商稱生意不錯。</p><p></p><p>美酒佳餚巡禮來到最後一天，下午人流明顯增多，展商亦落力推銷。</p><p></p><p>深圳旅客蕭小姐說：「(飲了)很多杯，飲了十多杯，我不算太飲得。」</p><p></p><p>陳小朋友稱：「吃了鮑魚、很好吃，很熱鬧、很好玩，但都不是玩的，食物很好吃。」</p><p></p><p>有售賣特色雞蛋仔和炒蜆的參展商稱，生意不錯。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.WINE 1830.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026scoe72a5Wh1793533714.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>餐廳廚藝總監周世韜說：「都真是無停過手，這數天人流很多，有些都等了一、兩小時，按以往經驗，都一直在增加雞蛋仔機，若明年再做就做好些，再買些機械回來做，預期目標都是增加一成至一成五。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.WINE 1830_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026AZ268EAOsw1793533794.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>有參展酒商稱，入場試酒人流，較去年多約兩成，銷情就同去年差不多。</p><p></p><p>參展酒商梁先生指出：「最後一日支裝酒會折扣會大些，再便宜多百分之五至十，如雞尾酒等，幾乎半賣半送。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.WINE 1830_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026lNibntFozn1793533770.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>參展酒商林先生表示：「很多客人不是特別注重價錢，最重要是適合飲，願意用合理價錢買酒，都樂意的，不會因為便宜很多而購買。」</p><p></p><p>今年美酒佳餚巡禮特設「咖啡園」專區，讓入場人士品嚐來自世界各地的精品咖啡、特色咖啡。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.WINE 2200_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026vHtjsI2IKI1793544558.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>入夜後，不少人都把握最後機會入場，品嚐美酒，多個區都逼滿人，部分攤檔出現排隊人龍。活動在午夜12時結束。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.WINE 2200.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026nGwDo4hUcz1793544545.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T01:26:15.946657+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":493,"images":6,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T14:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T09:58:29.900976+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T01:20:48.603673+00:00","content_hash":"86db36dd54fbb79dcb1872a0e3d72f6fc2046c7fc507e04b61991749344936ad","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T01:26:15.946657+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}